# Server-only API targets. Local defaults work without this file.
#
# For Vercel, set BOTH variables in Project Settings > Environment Variables to
# the HTTPS origin of the separately deployed API (no trailing /api). Do not
# use NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefixes: these values must not be exposed to the browser.
# INTENTRA_API_PROXY_TARGET=https://api.example.com
# INTENTRA_API_URL=https://api.example.com
